        "created_at": "2013-04-07T22:35:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have had two very weird games in a row</p><p>I had a very easy game against matriach ... who really didn't seem to do anything at all myself and three other players slapped her around<br><br>then we got destroyed by Baron Blade ... all dead before he flipped or got anywhere near pulling the moon into the earth (by the way my favourite flavour text)<br><br>Has anyone else had this happen?</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>As a side note we had to have our international tabletop day a week late, sentinels was played all day which is fantastic :)<br><br><br><br>&nbsp;</p>",
