        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-07T23:18:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Without specifics, I'd say it's totally expected that games can and will turn out very differently than you think they will.&nbsp;<span>A good or bad run on any deck can really swing the direction of the game.</span></p><p><span>And that's one of the (many) cool things about the game.</span></p>",
