        "id": 59156,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-08T02:43:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I recently played a game against IL that was really easy, the group I was playing with really lucked out. The first turn was a bit harsh ending with both AZ and Bunks at half life, but the Mars Base played a Meteor Storm, and we decided to ride it out. Bunks could destroy IL's ongoings so that they didn't pile up, and we all spent a few rounds setting up. We killed IL in one round after destroying the Meteor Storm with a Flash Flood. It's really easy to do 27 damage in one round when everyone's set up.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
