        "id": 59157,
        "name": "Vyolynce",
        "username": "Vyolynce",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-08T14:49:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ax_kidson\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ee59a6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ax_kidson:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>then we got destroyed by Baron Blade … all dead before he flipped or got anywhere near pulling the moon into the earth</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Wow. That's pretty unusual, as Blade shouldn't have enough damage access to take out (at least) three heroes that quickly. Was the enivornment a factor here? Failing that I guess a series of defense turrets and Hasten Doom into Slash and Burn could get there, but even with the weakest (lowest HP) collection of heroes around that's still around 75 damage before he gets fifteen cards in his trash, which seems insane.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
